 "text": "Navigation\nSkip to Content\nPersonal\nBusiness\nThe Bank\nFinance and Saving Pricing\nLog in\nOpen an account\n  عربي  \nManage Cookies\n\nWe use cookies or similar technologies to personalize content, analyze website traffic, and improve your user experience. You can customize the settings based on your preferences. Visit our Cookie Policy to learn more\n\nCustomize\nReject All\nAccept All\nHome - Personal Banking - anb\nFast & Simple Banking Experience\nGet Started\nWe’ve got you covered!\nShare your very own living space with loved ones.\nFixed installments\nFinancing up to 5 million SR\nFixed profit margin\nAn array of loan options\nReal Estate >\nWant to experience the world? Don’t hold back\n\nanb cards come loaded with offers, discounts, and other programs that suit your needs, as well as other benefits including a personal assistant, access to airport lounges, and insurance benefits.\n\nCredit cards >\n95000\nEarn while you spend. You deserve it\n\nEarn Points with each transaction \n\nanb Rewards >\nWho said things in life aren’t free?\n\nEasy Pay Program\n\nOffering various installments plans to meet your needs. Use your anb credit card to puchase all you want from furniture, electronic devices and more!\n\nLearn more >\nPersonal loan\nEasy process\nCompetitive profit margin\nEasy installments up to 60 months\nShariah Compliant\nLearn More\nOver 7m who chose anb\nJoin now!\n360 banking solutions\n\n \n\nDiscover how anb's solutions can help meet your financial goals today\n\n \n\n \n\nContact us\nOpen an account\nPersonal\nAccounts\nanb Platinum Program\nanb Gold Program\nPersonal Finance\nAuto Lease Finance\nReal Estate Finance\nCredit Cards\nIslamic Banking\nCorporate\nCorporate Banking\nCorporate Finance\nCommercial Banking\nSME\nTreasury\nOnline\nanb Net\nanb app\nTadawul\nFinance Calculator\nBranch Locator\nAbout\nAbout Us\nInvestor Relations\nCareers\nContact Us\nLondon Branch\nQuick Links\nTerms, Fees & Awareness\nReport Misconduct\nSupport & Assistance\nReach Us\n800 124 4040\nContact Us\n      \n\n \nDownload App Now:\n\n ​​       ​​\n\nArab National Bank (anb) - a Saudi joint stock co. - paid up capital SR. 20,000 Million - Unified No. 7000018007 - License No. 4017/m/a/254- National Address 7317 King Faisal Rd. Al Murabba, unit number 1, Riyadh 12613-3536 - P.O. Box 56921, Riyadh 11564, Kingdom of Saudi Arabia - Website: anb.com.sa - Telephone +966114029000 - Fax +966114027747 The Bank is regulated and supervised by Saudi Central Bank\n\n© 2026 anb. All Rights Reserved\nDisclaimer\nTerms & Conditions\nPrivacy\nCustomers Guide on Combating Fraud\nCyber Security Awareness\nSecurity tips\nAccessibility Menu\nአማርኛ (Amharic)\nالعربية (Arabic)\nбългарски (Bulgarian)\nবাংলা (Bengali)\nCatalà (Catalan)\nčeština (Czech)\nDanish (Denmark)\nDeutsch (German)\nΕλληνικά (Greek)\nEnglish (English)\nEspañol (Spanish)\nفارسی (Persian)\nsuomi (Finnish)\nTagalog (Filipno)\nFrançais (French)\nעברית (Hebrew)\nहिन्दी (Hindi)\nHrvatski (Croatian)\nMagyar (Hungarian)\nBahasa Indonesia (Indonesian)\nItaliano (Italian)\n日本語 (Japanese)\nქართული (Georgian)\nಕನ್ನಡ (Kannada)\n한국어 (Korean)\nKurdî (Kurdish)\nLëtzebuergesch (Luxembourgish)\nമലയാളം (Malayalam)\nМонгол (Mongolian)\nBahasa Malaysia (Malay)\nမြန်မာ (Burmese)\nNederlands (Dutch)\nNorsk (Norwegian)\nਪੰਜਾਬੀ (Punjabi)\nPolski (Polish)\nPortuguês (Portuguese)\nRomână (Romanian)\nРусский (Russian)\nSlovenščina (Slovene)\nslovenčina (Slovak)\nslovenščina (Slovenian)\nSrpski (Serbian)\nСрпски (Serbian Cyrillic)\nSvenska (Swedish)\nKiswahili (Swahili)\nதமிழ் (Tamil)\nతెలుగు (Telugu)\nไทย (Thai)\nTürkçe (Turkish)\nاردو (Urdu)\nTiếng Việt (Vietnamese)\n简体中文 (Simplified Chinese)\n繁體中文 (Traditional Chinese)\nContent Adjustments\nAdjust Font Size\n100%\nHighlight Title\nHighlight Links\nDyslexia Font\nLetter Spacing\nLine Height\nFont Weight\nColor Adjustments\nDark Contrast\nLight Contrast\nHigh Contrast\nHigh Saturation\nLow Saturation\nMonochrome\nTools\nReading Guide\nStop An